## Skill: GSAP Animations (ScrollTrigger + useGSAP)

### Patrones Aprobados

#### Stagger de entrada al hacer scroll
```tsx
useGSAP(() => {
  gsap.from('.card', {
    y: 50,
    opacity: 0,
    scale: 0.97,
    duration: 0.6,
    stagger: 0.07,
    ease: 'back.out(1.4)',
    clearProps: 'all',
    scrollTrigger: {
      trigger: container.current,
      start: 'top 80%',
    }
  })
}, { scope: container })
```

#### Timeline de sección (header → items)
```tsx
useGSAP(() => {
  const tl = gsap.timeline({
    scrollTrigger: {
      trigger: container.current,
      start: 'top 75%',
    }
  })
  
  tl.from('.section-header', {
    y: 30,
    opacity: 0,
    duration: 0.8,
    ease: 'power3.out'
  })
  .from('.section-item', {
    y: 40,
    opacity: 0,
    duration: 0.5,
    stagger: 0.06,
    ease: 'power2.out',
    clearProps: 'all'
  }, '-=0.4')
}, { scope: container })
```

#### Parallax de fondo
```tsx
useGSAP(() => {
  gsap.to('.bg-blob', {
    y: -100,
    ease: 'none',
    scrollTrigger: {
      trigger: container.current,
      start: 'top bottom',
      end: 'bottom top',
      scrub: 2,
    }
  })
}, { scope: container })
```

#### Número contador animado
```tsx
useGSAP(() => {
  gsap.from('.counter', {
    textContent: 0,
    duration: 1.5,
    ease: 'power2.out',
    snap: { textContent: 1 },
    scrollTrigger: {
      trigger: container.current,
      start: 'top 80%',
      once: true,
    }
  })
}, { scope: container })
```

### Reglas Críticas de GSAP
- `useGSAP` con `{ scope: container }` → cleanup automático garantizado
- Registrar plugins: `if (typeof window !== 'undefined') { gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger, useGSAP) }`
- Usar `clearProps: 'all'` en animaciones de cards para evitar que queden con `opacity: 0`
- Para `scrub`, usar valores entre 1-3 (no 0, no más de 4)
- Nunca animar `display` — animar siempre `opacity` + `y` + `scale`

